# Keep the Docker build context small. The agent build only needs the workspace
# crate sources + Cargo manifests/lock; everything below is irrelevant to it.
.git
target
**/target
macos/build
macos/tmp
tmp
docs
# Large binary test fixtures (raw I/Q + gzipped captures) - the agent image runs
# against a live feed (--feed), never the fixtures.
**/*.bin
**/tests/fixtures/ingest
# Web client build artifacts
airjedi-web/client/node_modules
airjedi-web/client/dist
